activity Submit Request
activity Review Request
activity Approve Request
activity Reject Request
activity Setup Remote Access
activity Update Payroll
activity Notify Employee
activity Monitor Performance
activity Revoke Access
activity Complete Survey
bind Submit Request: Request ID, Employee Name, Request Type
bind Review Request: Request ID, Manager ID
bind Approve Request: Request ID, Manager ID, Decision
bind Reject Request: Request ID, Manager ID, Decision
bind Setup Remote Access: Request ID, Access Status, Manager ID
bind Update Payroll: Request ID, Payroll Status
bind Notify Employee: Request ID, Notification Status
bind Monitor Performance: Manager ID, Performance Rating
bind Revoke Access: Request ID, Access Status
bind Complete Survey: Request ID, Survey Score
Request ID: integer between 1 and 99999
Employee Name: John Doe, Jane Smith, Alice Johnson
Request Type: Remote Work, Flexible Hours
Decision: Approved, Rejected
Payroll Status: Updated, Pending
Manager ID: integer between 1 and 9999
Access Status: Setup, Revoked
Performance Rating: Excellent, Good, Average, Poor
Notification Status: Sent, Pending
Survey Score: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Init[Submit Request] | |
End[Complete Survey] | |
Existence[Review Request] | |
Absence2[Revoke Access] | |
Exactly[Approve Request] | |
Responded Existence[Setup Remote Access, Approve Request] | | |
Precedence[Approve Request, Review Request] | | |
Precedence[Setup Remote Access, Approve Request] |A.Decision is Approved | |
Response[Approve Request, Notify Employee] |A.Decision is Approved |T.Notification Status is Sent |
Response[Reject Request, Notify Employee] |A.Decision is Rejected |T.Notification Status is Sent |
Succession[Approve Request, Update Payroll] |A.Decision is Approved |T.Payroll Status is Updated |
Alternate Response[Submit Request, Review Request] | | |
Alternate Succession[Approve Request, Setup Remote Access] | | |
Chain Response[Reject Request, Notify Employee] |A.Decision is Rejected |T.Notification Status is Sent |
Chain Precedence[Update Payroll, Approve Request] |A.Payroll Status is Updated |T.Decision is Approved |
Co-Existence[Setup Remote Access, Monitor Performance] | | |
Choice[Approve Request, Reject Request] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Approve Request, Reject Request] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Approve Request, Reject Request] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |
Not Responded Existence[Revoke Access, Setup Remote Access] | | |
Not Precedence[Notify Employee, Review Request] | | |
Not Response[Complete Survey, Submit Request] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |
Not Succession[Revoke Access, Setup Remote Access] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |
Not Chain Precedence[Notify Employee, Submit Request] | | |
Not Chain Response[Submit Request, Notify Employee] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Setup Remote Access, Revoke Access] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |